# Build context of Dockerfile.panel (the repo root): only the panel and the landing sources go in.
*
!kaptan-panel/
!kaptan-landing/
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/dist/
**/coverage/
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.tsbuildinfo
kaptan-panel/public/index.html
kaptan-panel/public/assets/
